## Exit criteria

- [ ] Probe includes the shared wording: eligibility, mandatory proposal for
  main-result relevance, duplicate-rejection limitation, alternate explicit
  rejection reason allowed, and no mandatory execution.
- [ ] Any parallel existing rule about checks not already run is reconciled
  consistently without changing signing authority or broader scope.
- [ ] A ticket-only handoff files the same wording to actual prompt owner
  replicator, names frozen artifacts to preserve, and reports remaining pickup
  accurately; no new global panel template/signing flow is invented.
- [ ] Person-written signatures and computational score/tolerance meanings
  remain unchanged. No new scientific run or general panel consent occurs.

